{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAFraDtv7SCvB3jRN4cX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013TosiZjighDsVNtE5mEhsq","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add recovery.go recovery_test.go && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nfix(recover): suppress http.ErrAbortHandler in recover\n\nhttp.ErrAbortHandler is the stdlib sentinel for aborting a handler\nwithout noise; net/http itself skips the stack trace for it. Recovery\ntreated it as a regular panic, logging a full stack and calling the\n500 handler. Handle it like a broken connection instead: log one line,\nrecord the error and abort.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Commit the fix"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":884,"cache_read_input_tokens":38778,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":884,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"76819db4-447d-4b46-b510-8b788496daac","uuid":"d7a6c724-7310-4ca8-bcc8-ece315e8228a","timestamp":"2026-10-18T19:30:06.566Z","request_id":"req_011CgAFrZzFgaaYkiwivgaax","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_013TosiZjighDsVNtE5mEhsq":{"command":"cd /tmp/tlw-qch4alh3 && git add recovery.go recovery_test.go && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nfix(recover): suppress http.ErrAbortHandler in recover\n\nhttp.ErrAbortHandler is the stdlib sentinel for aborting a handler\nwithout noise; net/http itself skips the stack trace for it. Recovery\ntreated it as a regular panic, logging a full stack and calling the\n500 handler. Handle it like a broken connection instead: log one line,\nrecord the error and abort.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log