{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAFrtcvQxEs2TWK8619o","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The fix is written and tested, but it isn't committed: git has no author name or email set here, and I didn't want to set one for you. The changes are staged.\n\n**What changed**\n- `recovery.go`: if a handler panics with `http.ErrAbortHandler`, the recovery middleware now handles it the way it already handles a broken pipe. It logs one line with no stack trace, records the error on the context and aborts, without calling the 500 handler. Wrapped copies of the error are caught too. The Go standard library server also skips the stack trace for this error, which is why I matched that.\n- `recovery_test.go`: new test `TestPanicWithAbortHandler`. It checks that the status code the handler set is kept and that the log has the short message but no \"panic recovered\" stack dump.\n\n**Why not more:** the broken-pipe handling already does what's needed, so the fix is 5 added lines with no new code path.\n\n**Checks run**\n- Before the fix, the new test failed for the reason the change targets: it got a 500 and a full stack trace. With `recovery.go` reverted, it fails again.\n- With the fix, the panic/recovery tests pass and `go test ./...` passes in every package.\n- `gofmt` and `go vet` report nothing.\n\n**Not done:** the commit. To finish, set `user.name` and `user.email` and run `git commit`; I wrote the message as \"fix(recover): suppress http.ErrAbortHandler in recover\". The repo is also on a detached HEAD, so create a branch first if you plan to open a PR."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":571,"cache_read_input_tokens":39662,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":571,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"76819db4-447d-4b46-b510-8b788496daac","uuid":"b8715279-7ccd-4c94-a6a7-8b19ca375441","timestamp":"2026-10-18T19:30:12.278Z","request_id":"req_011CgAFrtPXb3jMxsNxWLEsL"}
